    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d475">

                <pb facs="0702" n="600" xml:id="pg600"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">765.84/207: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Ethiopia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">George</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Addis Ababa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-03-18T10:00:00+02:35">March 18, 1935—10
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received March 18—9:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>26. My telegram No. 25.<anchor n="11" xml:id="d475-f1"/> Ethiopian delegation
                    Paris instructed to appeal to Geneva under clause 15 of Pact.<anchor n="12"
                        xml:id="d475-f2"/> Ethiopian chiefs are joining their troops.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">George</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
